8	 * Records how many existing owners already shared the new owner's first and last name (compared
9	 * case-insensitively) at the moment of creation. Runs before {@link SaveOwner}, so the count
10	 * excludes the owner currently being created. Mutates the built {@link Owner} in place.
11	 */
12	public class CountNamesakes {
13	
14	    public void service(@Val Owner owner, OwnerRepository ownerRepository) {
